 "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ヘッダー用のグレンさんのイラストをお願いしたいです！\n今のやつのリメイクでもいいですし、完全に描き下ろしでもお任せします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TOFUkuouze232/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ad574ce/uploads/origins/8ac7e67e-3342-4125-8a83-784baecd16d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc3e56ba5753130f5c42821d9cf53588", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ad574ce/uploads/origins/8ac7e67e-3342-4125-8a83-784baecd16d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc3e56ba5753130f5c42821d9cf53588, https://si.imgix.net/6ad574ce/uploads/origins/8ac7e67e-3342-4125-8a83-784baecd16d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2d298cd80581f9a8340a3eea672793c4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ad574ce/uploads/origins/8ac7e67e-3342-4125-8a83-784baecd16d0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=447c31edd87753f7d4f0e15af5aa7c37 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "VOIDではたくさんありがとうございました！\n実際に「この通りになるかどうかはさておきこういう淡島迅と葉限さんが見たい」というジョニーさんの念写が見たいです。\n対戦よろしくお願いします！！！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@TOFUkuouze232/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5b3c7327/uploads/origins/d385537f-1a68-4217-b19b-8e9dcf4debc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db961aa97ef7eda1cac6047233ed2c3f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5b3c7327/uploads/origins/d385537f-1a68-4217-b19b-8e9dcf4debc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db961aa97ef7eda1cac6047233ed2c3f, https://si.imgix.net/5b3c7327/uploads/origins/d385537f-1a68-4217-b19b-8e9dcf4debc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b926ff4f3779bfb46566cd4eb33791b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5b3c7327/uploads/origins/d385537f-1a68-4217-b19b-8e9dcf4debc0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34f1